# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over the
# context root's). The build context is the REPO ROOT — see the Dockerfile
# header — so allowlist exactly what it COPYs; everything else (node_modules,
# .git, dashboard builds, target/ trees) must not ship to the daemon.
*
!sandbox/docker/deepbook-indexer-fork/rpc-ingestion.patch
!sandbox/docker/deepbook-indexer-fork/entry-fork.sh
!external/deepbook/Cargo.toml
!external/deepbook/Cargo.lock
!external/deepbook/crates
# Host-build leftovers inside the submodule crates tree stay out.
external/deepbook/crates/**/target
